  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "这是与由紫特区使用了相同的\n全息投影的究极超级锦标赛赛程表！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 148,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F4E0E75317D2B7279533A4F7F75284E8676F8540C7684000A5168606F62955F7176847A7667818D857EA7952668078D5B8D5B7A0B8868FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一场由我举办，\n为我而办的锦标赛！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这能让大家都开心，\n因此是最棒的活动，完美的空间！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00573A753162114E3E529EFF0C000A4E3A6211800C529E7684952668078D5BFF0100100001BE01000A8FD980FD8BA959275BB690FD5F005FC3FF0C000A56E06B64662F670068D276846D3B52A8FF0C5B8C7F8E76847A7A95F4FF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "听说棱镜塔的状况已经到极限了，\n这可是密阿雷市的危机啊！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "542C8BF468F1955C5854768472B651B55DF27ECF5230678196504E86FF0C000A8FD953EF662F5BC6963F96F75E0276845371673A554AFF0100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要怎样才能让密阿雷市变得更好，\n我……责任很重大啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 384,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981600E6837624D80FD8BA95BC6963F96F75E0253D85F9766F4597DFF0C000A6211202620268D234EFB5F8891CD5927554A300200100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要由紫小姐满足了，\n一切事情都能平安结束……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898175317D2B5C0F59D06EE18DB34E86FF0C000A4E0052074E8B60C590FD80FD5E735B897ED3675F2026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "第2届超级由紫锦标赛……\n我既不想举办也不想出场……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B2C00325C4A8D857EA775317D2B952668078D5B20262026000A621165E24E0D60F34E3E529E4E5F4E0D60F351FA573A2026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "无论发生什么事，都由我来守护。\n不管是由紫小姐……还是大家！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65E08BBA53D1751F4EC04E484E8BFF0C90FD7531621167655B8862A43002000A4E0D7BA1662F75317D2B5C0F59D0202620268FD8662F59275BB6FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "与由紫小姐相遇的这份不幸……\n我非常能理解。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0E75317D2B5C0F59D076F8904776848FD94EFD4E0D5E7820262026000A6211975E5E3880FD740689E3300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "适合密阿雷这座城市的\n生命数量应该是一定的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "900254085BC6963F96F78FD95EA757CE5E027684000A751F547D657091CF5E948BE5662F4E005B9A768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我倒是觉得宝可梦增加\n就等于会有更多的疗愈。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115012662F89C95F975B9D53EF68A6589E52A0000A5C317B494E8E4F1A670966F4591A76847597610830020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在这座和宝可梦共同生活的城市，\n作为训练家的能力将受到考验。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57288FD95EA7548C5B9D53EF68A65171540C751F6D3B768457CE5E02FF0C000A4F5C4E3A8BAD7EC35BB6768480FD529B5C0653D7523080039A8C30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "由紫小姐她很清楚要改变城市，\n实力是必不可少的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75317D2B5C0F59D059795F886E05695A8981653953D857CE5E02FF0C000A5B9E529B662F5FC54E0D53EF5C11768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "想打造各种人和各种宝可梦\n都满意的城市根本就是天方夜谭吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "60F362539020540479CD4EBA548C540479CD5B9D53EF68A6000A90FD6EE1610F768457CE5E026839672C5C31662F592965B9591C8C2D542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对大家来说，即使是天方夜谭，\n让人感到有可能也是很重要的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF959275BB667658BF4FF0C53734F7F662F592965B9591C8C2DFF0C000A8BA94EBA611F5230670953EF80FD4E5F662F5F8891CD8981768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所谓的好城市就是便利的城市吧？\n真期待都市开发能让城市变得便利。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408C137684597D57CE5E025C31662F4FBF5229768457CE5E025427FF1F000A771F671F5F8590FD5E025F0053D180FD8BA957CE5E0253D85F974FBF522930020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "回过神来就发现和记忆不同……\n城市的变化就是这么一回事。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56DE8FC7795E67655C3153D173B0548C8BB05FC64E0D540C20262026000A57CE5E02768453D853165C31662F8FD94E484E0056DE4E8B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是提供的东西不到位，就会让\n酒店的评价下降，所以我很紧张。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F63D04F9B76844E1C897F4E0D52304F4DFF0C5C314F1A8BA9000A91525E9776848BC44EF74E0B964DFF0C62404EE562115F887D275F2030020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "招待从容不迫的人们\n真是轻松啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DB5F854ECE5BB94E0D8FEB76844EBA4EEC000A771F662F8F7B677E554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    }
